      "text": "Avoidable retries"
    },
    {
      "rect": [418, 392, 319, 15],
      "role": "text",
      "text": "ranked by sessions with a retry, then sessions, then retries"
    },
    {
      "rect": [280, 419, 1136, 30],
      "role": "text",
      "text": "A retry is a failed call followed within 3 calls by a similar call of the same tool that succeeded: a round trip a rule or an env fix would have saved. Retry time is the call-to-call gap; context re-read is what the retrying model call carried. Neither is added to the other."
    },
